<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Staples, Office Depot upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Staples, Office Depot upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- A.G. Edwards said analyst Don Spindel on Thursday raised his ratings for both Office Depot Inc and Staples Inc to maintain from reduce.</p>
<p>-- Shares in Office Depot were unchanged at 22-5/8. Shares in Staples were unchanged at 22.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
